      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Python \n\n* .py is the format \n\n\n* during compliation to bytecode(.pyc or .pyo)\npyhton interpereter converts the source code into an intermediate bytecode\na lower level representation\n\n* the python virtual machine reads and executes the bytecode ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Python \n\n* .py is the format \n\n\n* during compliation to bytecode(.pyc or .pyo)\npyhton interpereter converts the source code into an intermediate bytecode\na lower level representation\n\n* the python virtual machine reads and executes the bytecode ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
