      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dictionary \n\n\nkey value format \n\na map represents a group of elementsin the form of key value paris so that when the kye is given, we can retrieve the value associated with it .\n\nThis dict datatype is an example for a map \n\nex d = {10: 'Surya',  11: 'sdkf', 12\" 'ranu'. 13: 'aksdfj'",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dictionary \n\n\nkey value format \n\na map represents a group of elementsin the form of key value paris so that when the kye is given, we can retrieve the value associated with it .\n\nThis dict datatype is an example for a map \n\nex d = {10: 'Surya',  11: 'sdkf', 12\" 'ranu'. 13: 'aksdfj'",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UVm5m6Fkk12lbyUQ1yNFY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -18.74179285856991,
      "y": 8342.944637221237,
      "width": 858.6396484375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
